    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem balanced_primes_order :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ k > 0, {n : ℕ | k ≤ n ∧ 2 * k * Nat.nth Prime n = ∑ i ∈ .Ioc 0 k,\n      ((n - i).nth Prime + (n + i).nth Prime)}.Infinite",
